<h1 style="font-size: 18pt; color: #e21833; font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; margin: 20px 0 5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 4px;">Shell Shop Order in Workday</h1>
<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 11pt; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #eee;"><a style="color: #0056b3; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;" href="#storefront" rel="nofollow">Shell Shop Storefront</a> | <a style="color: #0056b3; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;" href="#completion" rel="nofollow">Completion of the REQ</a> | <a style="color: #0056b3; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;" href="#attachments" rel="nofollow">Document Attachments</a> | <a style="color: #0056b3; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;" href="#after" rel="nofollow">Post-Submission Steps</a></div>
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;">The following are step-by-step instructions for completing a &ldquo;Shell Shop Order&rdquo; in Workday. Use Shell Shop orders for any company listed as a Storefront supplier in Shell Shop. If the supplier is not a Shell Shop supplier, use Non-Catalog Orders in Workday instructions.</p>
<div style="background-color: #fcf8e3; border-left: 4px solid #f0ad4e; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color: #a94442; display: block; margin-bottom: 10pt; font-size: 12pt;">Note: Labor Cost Configuration for Capital Assets</strong>
<p style="margin: 0 0 10pt 0;">When a Capital Asset and Labor/Installation is included on the requisition, calculate the specific labor cost allocation using the following formula sequence:</p>
<div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; color: #444;">1. [Capital Asset Amount] x 100 = [Base Multiplier]<br>2. [Base Multiplier] &divide; [Total Labor/Installation Amount] = [Factor]<br>3. [Factor] x 100 = <strong>Labor Cost Allocation</strong></div>
<strong style="color: #242424; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">Example:</strong>
<p style="margin: 0 0 10pt 0; font-family: monospace; background-color: #fff; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;">$5,200 (CA) x 100 = 520,000 &divide; $33,000 (L) = 15.7575 x 100 = <strong>$1,575.00</strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 8pt 0; font-style: italic; color: #555;">*This calculated amount represents the labor cost for the individual Capital Asset. It must be entered as a distinct line item on the REQ and subsequently subtracted from the gross total of the primary Installation/Labor line item. Under <strong>"Review Required"&nbsp;</strong>use&nbsp;<strong>"Modify System or Asset"</strong>, and in the memo of this line item, note the description of the Capital Asset for labor cost.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: #555;">** Subtract all individual labor cost entries from the total cost of the Installation/Labor line item.</p>
</div>
