<h2 id="completion" style="font-size: 14pt; color: #454545; font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; margin: 24px 0 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 4px;">Completion of the REQ</h2>
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;">The comprehensive breakdown below details the remaining administrative information inputs required during order checkout phases to ensure successful routing logs.</p>
<div style="background-color: #fafafa; padding: 14px 18px; border-left: 4px solid #454545; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 11pt;"><strong style="display: block; color: #242424; margin-bottom: 8px;">Checkout checklist</strong>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.7;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;"><strong>Memo to Suppliers Block:</strong> Input your reference quote identifiers along with target end-user / structural destination profiles.<br><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 4px 8px; margin-top: 4px; font-family: monospace;">Format Example: Quote #987654 - Attn: Jane Doe / Room 3520</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;"><strong>Internal Memo Field:</strong> Re-apply the strict string index layout applied at row levels:<br><span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #fff; border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 4px 8px; margin-top: 4px; font-family: monospace;">Project Code / FY / Vendor Name / Item Details</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;"><strong>Audit Checks:</strong> Scroll through the system autofill text fields to confirm the accuracy of institutional profile information.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0;"><img style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=7ec9591a47841f142590bcab116d4313" alt="Workday Checkout Panel" width="469" height="301"></p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 20px; color: #666; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;"><em>Review supplier memo, internal memo, and requisition details.</em></p>
<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 10px 16px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>Requested Delivery Date Field:</strong> Open the system calendar dialog and specify the exact date the baseline document packet is being submitted to workflows.</div>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0;"><img style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=fec9591a47841f142590bcab116d432e" alt="Workday Delivery Date Scheduling Form Panel" width="686" height="249"></p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 20px; color: #666; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;"><em>Set the requested delivery date for workflow submission.</em></p>
<div style="background-color: #fcf8e3; border-left: 4px solid #f0ad4e; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 24px 0 20px; font-size: 11pt;"><strong style="color: #a94442; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12pt;">Line Item Financial Audit Guardrails (&gt;$5K Rules)</strong>
<ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;"><strong>Review Required Flag:</strong> This dropdown choice is absolutely mandatory for each singular line element containing an individual <strong>Unit Cost of $5,000 or greater</strong>.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;">Select the option attribute value marked <strong>"New"</strong> in most instances. Alternate values are reserved for formal Change Orders processed by designated Cost Center managers.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;"><strong>Additional Worktags Warning:</strong> <strong>Do NOT delete, overwrite, or mutate</strong> any automatically mapped strings or values populated inside this column field.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0;"><img style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=3ac9591a47841f142590bcab116d4329" alt="Workday Line Item Worktags and Asset Valuation Field Panel" width="689" height="236"></p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 20px; color: #666; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;"><em>Review line-item worktags and asset valuation; leave auto-populated values intact.</em></p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;"><em>*Note on Services: Service lines require no secondary data entries during checkout stages, as full lifecycle dates remain captured during initial line creation.</em></p>
<h2 id="attachments" style="font-size: 14pt; color: #454545; font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; margin: 24px 0 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 4px;">Document Attachments Module</h2>
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;">To finalize compliance metrics, drag and drop target file sheets directly into the active UI Drop Zone, or select files manually via system explorers.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0;"><img style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=3ec9591a47841f142590bcab116d4315" alt="Workday Drag and Drop File Upload Zone Interface" width="566" height="172"></p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 20px; color: #666; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;"><em>Add the required supporting documents to the upload queue.</em></p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;">Once files populate the upload queue, you must apply explicit indexing metrics to each item:</p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 10pt; padding-inline-start: 24px;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;">Assign a matching <strong>Attachment Category</strong> from the default profile dictionary catalog.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;">Add a concise document summary within the <strong>Comments</strong> block or paste the standardized <strong>Internal Memo</strong> string.</li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 8pt;">Ensure the checkbox option labeled <strong>"External"</strong> remains <span style="text-decoration: underline;">unchecked</span>.</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0;"><img style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=f6c9591a47841f142590bcab116d434b" alt="Workday Document Comment and Privacy Attribute Controls" width="566" height="123"></p>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 20px; color: #666; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;"><em>Set the attachment category and comments; leave External unchecked.</em></p>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;" align="left">
<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;"><colgroup><col style="width: 40%;"><col style="width: 60%;"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 10px 15px 10px 0;"><img style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; max-width: 100%; height: auto;" src="/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=76c9591a47841f142590bcab116d432b" alt="Workday Attachment Category Dropdown Selection Panel" width="223" height="223"><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; color: #666; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center;"><em>Choose the attachment category that best describes each file.</em></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align: top;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;"><strong>Attachment Category Selection Matrix</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-bottom: 10pt; padding-inline-start: 24px;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 6pt;"><strong>Delegated Agreement Requiring Signature:</strong> Maps to any contract, software licensing agreement, or legal text sheet requiring formal UMD administrative signature clearance.</li>
